### ============================================
### MENU SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/modifiers

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/modifiers

### Create a new modifier
### Request Body: ModifierDto
### Response: Created ModifierDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Extra Cheese",
  "description": "Add extra slice of cheese",
  "priceAdjustment": 1.50
}

### Get modifier by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: ModifierDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all modifiers
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<ModifierDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/category/{categoryId}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update modifier by ID
### Request Body: ModifierDto
### Response: Updated ModifierDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete modifier by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json